    "It is a quiet Monday in the Hub after a weekend that felt like an eternity, but the C's are back at TD Garden tonight for a conference clash with the Chicago Bulls. We are sitting at one and one on the young season, and frankly, I am looking for a statement performance to settle the nerves before I start pacing holes in my living room rug. We have seen some flashes, but now is the time to really lock in and defend home court against a team we should be treating like a speed bump if we have championship aspirations.",
